---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import data from '../../../../data/generated/tool-common.json';
import { marked } from 'marked';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(v:string)=>`${base.replace(/\/?$/, '/')}${v.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`;
const html=marked.parse(data.pages.zh.overview);
---
<SiteLayout title="tool-common" lang="zh">
<section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">组件 / tool-common</span><h1>tool-common</h1>
<div class="page-tabs"><a class="primary-tab" href={href('/components/tool-common/api/')}>HTTP API</a><a href={href('/components/tool-common/subject-identity/')}>Subject Identity</a><a href={href('/components/tool-common/boundaries/')}>职责边界</a><a href={href('/components/tool-common/')}>概览</a></div></section>
<section class="section prose" set:html={html}></section>
<section class="section"><div class="notice"><strong>两套接口是分开的。</strong> Provider listener 给 Runtime/Host 做只读 lookup；Control listener 只给可信配置和 reset 使用，不是 Agent Tool。</div></section>
</SiteLayout>